d-1}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13974625/state.json" "file_sha256" "9814a4531e17fe49bb1f083f103f7469b3c9e047892270b9acb9782ad4a636fc"} {"question" "q-274501" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we recall the difference formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡(u-v)=\\operatorname{cos}⁡u\\operatorname{cos}⁡v+\\operatorname{sin}⁡u\\operatorname{sin}⁡v\n$$\n\nApplying the difference formula for cosine with $u=x$ and $v=\\frac{\\pi }{2},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-\\frac{\\pi }{2}) & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\cdot 0+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13974625/state.json" "file_sha256" "9814a4531e17fe49bb1f083f103f7469b3c9e047892270b9acb9782ad4a636fc"} {"question" "q-274501" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13974625/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "7e7928bc2cc2fb6d53e35f0a26bf639103a3e815bb732f622827a8049fd47483"} {"question" "q-274501" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13974625/state.json" "file_sha256" "9814a4531e17fe49bb1f083f103f7469b3c9e047892270b9acb9782ad4a636fc"} {"question" "q-274501" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\sin(x)"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13974625/state.json" "file_sha256" "9814a4531e17fe49bb1f083f103f7469b3c9e047892270b9acb9782ad4a636fc"} {"question" "q-332512" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Express $\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-{60}^{∘})$ in terms of $\\operatorname{sin}⁡x$ and $\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.$\n\n$\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-{60}^{∘})=$\n{{field-1}}$\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,+$\n{{field-2}}$\\operatorname{cos}⁡x$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13974625/state.json" "file_sha256" "9814a4531e17fe49bb1f083f103f7469b3c9e047892270b9acb9782ad4a636fc"} {"question" "q-332512" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we recall the difference formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡(u-v)=\\operatorname{cos}⁡u\\operatorname{cos}⁡v+\\operatorname{sin}⁡u\\operatorname{sin}⁡v\n$$\n\nApplying the difference formula for cosine with $u=x$ and $v={60}^{∘}$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-{60}^{∘}) & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡{60}^{∘}+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{sin}⁡{60}^{∘} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13974625/state.json" "file_sha256" "9814a4531e17fe49bb1f083f103f7469b3c9e047892270b9acb9782ad4a636fc"} {"question" "q-332512" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13974625/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "7e7928bc2cc2fb6d53e35f0a26bf639103a3e815bb732f622827a8049fd47483"} {"question" "q-332512" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/